    "witness": "The exact frozen original 66 selected anchors, not newly selected or modified.",
    "hash_without_final_witness_predicates": "For each of the same 66 available cells select the minimum original selection digest over all pre-consider candidates, ignoring every final conditions argument to Pools.consider. No repeated salt, sampling or replacement."
