  "whole_candidate_universe_definition": {
    "exact_algorithm": "Use the pinned original enumerate_pools(data,pool) unchanged, replacing only Pools.consider with a collector that records every call and ignores its final conditions argument for ranking. All candidate identities and the original predicate values are preserved in five compressed JSONL files. They and both complete selections are hashed in selection_freeze.json before any reference or control SQL is executed.",
    "actual_cohorts": "Pack strata: each distinct pack with at least one cr_in_pack member. Meeting strata: each resolution meeting with at least one source_verified whole_target disposition in the original raw parser. These are actual observed cohorts, not every theoretically possible meeting.",
    "document_pairs": "Each unordered pair of distinct member documents of the same pack that shares at least one complete typed (spec,release,clause) identity. Intersection strata use the sorted pair once; directed-difference strata use both orientations. The shared typed identity is an original enumerator restriction retained in the baseline; the additional three-nonempty-regions and release-collision conditions are removed.",
    "section_pairs": "Each distinct unordered full typed-section pair co-occurring on at least one member of the same pack. The observed co-occurrence is retained in the baseline; the additional both/first-only/second-only regions, release collision and changed-histogram requirements are removed.",
    "maximum_and_absence": "Each distinct actual pack with at least one membership. For maximum strata remove final positive-size variation, ties and release-change predicates. For absence remove mixed-presence/absence predicate.",
    "necessary_vs_witness": "Identity typing, actual membership, actual cohort presence, shared typed-section document-pair enumeration and co-occurring section-pair enumeration define this comparator cohort. Some structural restrictions also constrain the possible outputs; outcome-blind here means ignoring the final witness predicates, not removing all semantic conditioning or sampling natural demand.",
    "expected_calls_all95cells": 2269290,
